                <mxCell id="50" value="MERGE:&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 11px; text-align: center; white-space: normal;&quot;&gt;§6&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 11px; text-align: center; white-space: normal;&quot;&gt;§7&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Os passos 6 e 7 repetem muito a invocação das skils:&lt;br&gt;security-scanner&lt;br&gt;spec-validator&lt;br&gt;as skills podem ser chamadas uma unica vez.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;impl-review&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;ficaria assim:&lt;br&gt;chama o reviewer de dominio (prd/sre/data) [phase-impl-delta + spec-validator]&lt;br&gt;se reprovou = REWORK&lt;br&gt;se passou = PROCEED ANALISYS&lt;br&gt;se ambiguo = ASK USER (somente se encontrar algum problema que precise ação de usuario.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; white-space: normal;&quot;&gt;revisão cross-domain&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; white-space: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; white-space: normal;&quot;&gt;(spec, segurança, critérios de aceite)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; white-space: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; white-space: normal;&quot;&gt;→ relatório + proposed spec updates&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;security-scanner&lt;br&gt;spec-validator&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontStyle=0;