                <mxCell id="49" value="MERGE:plan-reviewer-1&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;unificar as duas etapas e eliminar o scrum.&lt;br&gt;apos as tasks prd/spectech/tasks, invoca o plan-reviewer&lt;br&gt;se reprovado = REWORK&lt;br&gt;se ambiguo = ASK USER&lt;br&gt;se passou e manual = ASK USER para aceitar, reprovar ou comentar&lt;br&gt;se passou e auto = PROCEED&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;evita duas rodadas de analise e decisões&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
